 263:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @brief Configures the main internal regulator output voltage.
 264:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @param  VoltageScaling specifies the regulator output voltage to achieve
 265:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *         a tradeoff between performance and power consumption.
 266:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
 267:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *            @arg PWR_REGULATOR_VOLTAGE_SCALE1: Regulator voltage output range 1 mode,
 268:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                               the maximum value of fHCLK is 168 MHz. It can be 
 269:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                               180 MHz by activating the over-drive mode.
 270:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *            @arg PWR_REGULATOR_VOLTAGE_SCALE2: Regulator voltage output range 2 mode,
 271:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                               the maximum value of fHCLK is 144 MHz. It can be 
 272:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                               168 MHz by activating the over-drive mode.
 273:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *            @arg PWR_REGULATOR_VOLTAGE_SCALE3: Regulator voltage output range 3 mode,
 274:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   *                                               the maximum value of fHCLK is 120 MHz.
 275:board/stm32f401rct6/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_pwr_ex.c ****   * @note To update the system clock frequency(SYSCLK):
